  "system": {
    "description": "<p>You throw a smoldering ball of fire at your enemies.</p><p>Choose a point within <strong>10 spaces</strong>. Each creature within a <strong>5-space-radius</strong> of that point takes <strong>1</strong> <strong>Damage</strong> as the area erupts in flames.</p><p>The fire spreads around corners and ignites flammable objects in the area.</p><p>Additionally, the affected area gains the <strong>Hazard (1)</strong> trait until the start of your next turn.</p><p>Each extra success increases the <strong>Damage</strong> by <strong>+1</strong>.</p><p>Alternatively, you can choose to extend the duration of the <strong>Hazard</strong> trait by <strong>+1 rounds</strong> per extra success.</p>",
